1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
Rain begins in the ocean.

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,910
The sun heats the water
and turns it into vapor.

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:08,270
High in the sky, the vapor
cools and forms clouds.

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:12,820
When the drops become heavy, they fall
back to the earth as rain, filling rivers

5
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:13,860
and lakes.
